+# Volt rear glass extended farther down — 2026-10-29
+
+VGL01: The owner asks for the rear window to continue a little farther down. V22 extends its lower boundary farther aft and slightly downward toward the trunk. The underlying glass edge moves 50 mm aft and 20 mm down in authored model space; the visible inset edge moves 43.8 mm aft and 17.5 mm down at car scale. The painted apron becomes shorter and its tangent control adapts to the remaining space. The trunk deck, lower cabin, corrected front windows and earlier windshield advance remain.
+
+Runtime scope is three edits in `game/vehicle/electric_coachwork.gd`: prepared asset version, rear-glass endpoint, and apron tangent length. Shape24, continuity58, native model34 and racing23 pass; owned-source parsing also passes. Checks run through the pinned engine using `run_checks.py`; exact commands, exits and final source hashes are in [commands.json](evidence/volt-rear-glass-lower-2026-10-29/commands.json). [report.json](evidence/volt-rear-glass-lower-2026-10-29/report.json) records the actual results, native-buffer measurements and preserved resources. The inherited historical minimum-roof-height limitation from v21 remains outside this small change.
+
+[Native rear view](evidence/volt-rear-glass-lower-2026-10-29/preview/rear-quarter-clean.png), [lower rear view](evidence/volt-rear-glass-lower-2026-10-29/preview/rear-low-clean.png), [review patch](evidence/volt-rear-glass-lower-2026-10-29/task.patch), and [forward/reverse checkpoint](evidence/volt-rear-glass-lower-2026-10-29/checkpoint.json). Prepared v22 meshes, five shadows, the Volt Garage template and 52 native pictures refresh. V21 resources and current car configurations are preserved; shared manifests retain concurrent context. No other vehicle source is edited.
+
+Reload/rebuild and owner appearance acceptance remain. No physical-device query/test, APK, owner-save/live/backend mutation, deployment, owner-process restart or shared-index staging/commit/merge was performed. No aerodynamic or phone-performance improvement is claimed.
